=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir von Ar-Rahmaan 55:58 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"als wären sie Rubine und Korallen.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Startseite\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Ar-Rahmaan\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/surah/55.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Vers 58\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/55-58.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> › <a href=\"/de/surah/55.html\">Sura Ar-Rahmaan</a> › Vers 58</nav><h1>Tafsir von Sura Ar-Rahmaan 55:58</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿كَأَنَّهُنَّ الْيَاقُوتُ وَالْمَرْجَانُ﴾</p><section><h3>Übersetzung der Bedeutung</h3><p class=\"tr\">als wären sie Rubine und Korallen.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">German Translation - Frank Bubenheim — v1.1.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Die Worte der beiden Imame werden im arabischen Original wortgetreu und mit Quellenangaben wiedergegeben.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><h3>Was er von anderen überliefert hat</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">الحسن وعامة المفسرين</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «أراد صفاء الياقوت في بياض المرجان»<cite>«حادي الأرواح إلى بلاد الأفراح» 1/223</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">ابن قتيبة</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «أي لهن ألوان المرجان في صفاء الياقوت»<cite>«حادي الأرواح إلى بلاد الأفراح» 1/194</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">عبد الله</span> <span class=\"st\">استشهد به</span> «إن المرأة من النساء أهل الجنة لتلبس عليها سبعين حلة من حرير فيرى بياض ساقيها من ورائهن ذلك بأن الله يقول: {كأنهن الياقوت والمرجان} إلا وإن الياقوت حجر لو جعلت فيه سلكا ثم استصفيته نظرت إلى السلك من وراء الحجر»<cite>«حادي الأرواح إلى بلاد الأفراح» 1/223</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=de#s55a58\">Im interaktiven Tafsir öffnen (vollständige Texte)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/de/ayah/55-46.html\">Vorheriger Vers (55:46)</a><a href=\"/de/ayah/55-60.html\">Nächster Vers (55:60)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir der beiden Schaichs · <a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Über das Projekt</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Datenschutz &amp; Bedingungen</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/55-60.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir von Ar-Rahmaan 55:60 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Ist der Lohn des Guten nicht ebenfalls das Gute?\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/55-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/55-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/55-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/55-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/55-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/55-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/55-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/55-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/55-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/55-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/55-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/55-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/55-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/55-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/55-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/55-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/55-60.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir von Ar-Rahmaan 55:60 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Ist der Lohn des Guten nicht ebenfalls das Gute?\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Startseite\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Ar-Rahmaan\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/surah/55.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Vers 60\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/55-60.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> › <a href=\"/de/surah/55.html\">Sura Ar-Rahmaan</a> › Vers 60</nav><h1>Tafsir von Sura Ar-Rahmaan 55:60</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿هَلْ جَزَاءُ الْإِحْسَانِ إِلَّا الْإِحْسَانُ﴾</p><section><h3>Übersetzung der Bedeutung</h3><p class=\"tr\">Ist der Lohn des Guten nicht ebenfalls das Gute?</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">German Translation - Frank Bubenheim — v1.1.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Die Worte der beiden Imame werden im arabischen Original wortgetreu und mit Quellenangaben wiedergegeben.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">يعني هل جزاء من أحسن عبادة ربه إلا أن يحسن ربه إليه<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 3/18</cite></blockquote><h3>Was er von anderen überliefert hat</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">ابن عباس</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «قال ابن عباس: &quot;هل جزاء من قال لا إله إلا الله وعمل بما جاء به محمد إلا الجنة&quot;»<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 3/18</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم</span> <span class=\"st\">استشهد به</span> «قال: &quot;قرأ رسول الله {هل جزاء الإحسان إلا الإحسان} ثم قال: هل تدرون ما قال ربكم؟ قالوا الله ورسوله أعلم قال: يقول هل جزاء من أنعمت عليه بالتوحيد إلا الجنة &quot;.»<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 3/18</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=de#s55a60\">Im interaktiven Tafsir öffnen (vollständige Texte)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/de/ayah/55-58.html\">Vorheriger Vers (55:58)</a><a href=\"/de/ayah/55-68.html\">Nächster Vers (55:68)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir der beiden Schaichs · <a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Über das Projekt</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Datenschutz &amp; Bedingungen</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/55-68.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir von Ar-Rahmaan 55:68 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Darin sind Früchte und Palmen und Granatäpfel.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/55-68.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/55-68.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/55-68.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/55-68.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/55-68.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/55-68.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/55-68.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/55-68.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/55-68.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/55-68.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/55-68.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/55-68.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/55-68.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/55-68.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/55-68.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/55-68.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/55-68.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir von Ar-Rahmaan 55:68 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Darin sind Früchte und Palmen und Granatäpfel.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Startseite\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Ar-Rahmaan\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/surah/55.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Vers 68\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/55-68.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> › <a href=\"/de/surah/55.html\">Sura Ar-Rahmaan</a> › Vers 68</nav><h1>Tafsir von Sura Ar-Rahmaan 55:68</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿فِيهِمَا فَاكِهَةٌ وَنَخْلٌ وَرُمَّانٌ﴾</p><section><h3>Übersetzung der Bedeutung</h3><p class=\"tr\">Darin sind Früchte und Palmen und Granatäpfel.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">German Translation - Frank Bubenheim — v1.1.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Die Worte der beiden Imame werden im arabischen Original wortgetreu und mit Quellenangaben wiedergegeben.</p><section><h2>Schaich al-Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ولم يدل التقديم في شيء من هذه المواضع على فضل المبدوء به<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 4/386</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=de#s55a68\">Im interaktiven Tafsir öffnen (vollständige Texte)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/de/ayah/55-60.html\">Vorheriger Vers (55:60)</a><a href=\"/de/ayah/55-70.html\">Nächster Vers (55:70)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir der beiden Schaichs · <a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Über das Projekt</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Datenschutz &amp; Bedingungen</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/55-70.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lan